{"content_hash": "8a43ba658b678cf9", "version_id": 902, "article_id": 91, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Chinese shopper lets AI buy for Double 11 and finds some wrong prices", "title_zh": "双十一让AI帮忙买东西，结果发现有些推荐不靠谱", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8196807.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1657049016607-0a376708752f?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8aGVscGVycyUyMGZhaWwlMjBmaW5kfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQwOTkwNzJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Steve Lieman on Unsplash", "author": "Steve Lieman", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@stevelieman?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-little-girl-playing-in-the-grass-XeFzJmAjRxY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(27, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(65, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "0183c75384c8"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-08", "word_count": 162, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "A shopper in China asked three shopping apps to find the best prices for Double 11. The AI tools found real prices, but some of their picks had problems.", "lead_zh": "一位中国消费者让三个购物App帮忙找双十一最低价。这些AI给出的价格是真的，但有些推荐存在问题。", "preview": "Double 11 started in mid-October this year. The shopper gave Taobao, JD.com and Doubao a list of four things to buy. These were an iPhone 17", "preview_zh": "今年双十一从十月中旬就开始了。这位消费者把四样东西的清单交给了淘宝、京东和豆包，分别是iPhone 17 Pro、AirPods Pro 3、纸巾和坚果。然后他在商品页面上逐一核对了价格。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 885, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 57.55, "size_bytes": 346320, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 193, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 58.475, "size_bytes": 351792, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 193, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 62.05, "size_bytes": 373248, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 193, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 54.275, "size_bytes": 326592, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 193, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 56.425, "size_bytes": 339552, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 193, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@5b2e2d0/content/data/versions/902.json", "paragraphs": ["Double 11 started in mid-October this year. The shopper gave Taobao, JD.com and Doubao a list of four things to buy. These were an iPhone 17 Pro, AirPods Pro 3, tissues and nuts. He then checked every price on the product pages.", "The AI tools did not make up prices. Taobao's AI said clearly that some iPhones were used or refurbished. Doubao added up the four prices fast, but its total was a little wrong. JD.com's AI found a cheap pair of earphones that looked fake.", "One tool, Lingguang 2.0, watched prices for him. It sent a message when the iPhone dropped below 7500 yuan. The final price was about 7259 yuan, around 740 yuan less than the page price.", "But the earphone test showed a problem. JD.com's AI warned him about a fake product. Later, it recommended earphones marked as refurbished, and a shop that could not sell to him. The prices were real, but the advice was not always good."], "paragraphs_zh": ["今年双十一从十月中旬就开始了。这位消费者把四样东西的清单交给了淘宝、京东和豆包，分别是iPhone 17 Pro、AirPods Pro 3、纸巾和坚果。然后他在商品页面上逐一核对了价格。", "这些AI工具没有编造价格。淘宝AI明确说明有些iPhone是二手或资源机。豆包很快算出了四件商品的总价，但总价有一点点错误。京东的AI找到了一副便宜的耳机，看起来像是假货。", "还有一个叫灵光2.0的工具帮他盯着价格。当iPhone降到7500元以下时，它发来了消息。最终到手价约为7259元，比页面价便宜了大约740元。", "但耳机测试暴露了一个问题。京东的AI提醒他有一件假货。后来，它却推荐了标注为资源机的耳机，还有一家无法向他销售的店铺。价格是真的，但建议并不总是靠谱。"], "body": "Double 11 started in mid-October this year. The shopper gave Taobao, JD.com and Doubao a list of four things to buy. These were an iPhone 17 Pro, AirPods Pro 3, tissues and nuts. He then checked every price on the product pages.\n\nThe AI tools did not make up prices. Taobao's AI said clearly that some iPhones were used or refurbished. Doubao added up the four prices fast, but its total was a little wrong. JD.com's AI found a cheap pair of earphones that looked fake.\n\nOne tool, Lingguang 2.0, watched prices for him. It sent a message when the iPhone dropped below 7500 yuan. The final price was about 7259 yuan, around 740 yuan less than the page price.\n\nBut the earphone test showed a problem. JD.com's AI warned him about a fake product. Later, it recommended earphones marked as refurbished, and a shop that could not sell to him. The prices were real, but the advice was not always good.", "body_zh": "今年双十一从十月中旬就开始了。这位消费者把四样东西的清单交给了淘宝、京东和豆包，分别是iPhone 17 Pro、AirPods Pro 3、纸巾和坚果。然后他在商品页面上逐一核对了价格。\n\n这些AI工具没有编造价格。淘宝AI明确说明有些iPhone是二手或资源机。豆包很快算出了四件商品的总价，但总价有一点点错误。京东的AI找到了一副便宜的耳机，看起来像是假货。\n\n还有一个叫灵光2.0的工具帮他盯着价格。当iPhone降到7500元以下时，它发来了消息。最终到手价约为7259元，比页面价便宜了大约740元。\n\n但耳机测试暴露了一个问题。京东的AI提醒他有一件假货。后来，它却推荐了标注为资源机的耳机，还有一家无法向他销售的店铺。价格是真的，但建议并不总是靠谱。", "text": "Double 11 started in mid-October this year. The shopper gave Taobao, JD.com and Doubao a list of four things to buy. These were an iPhone 17 Pro, AirPods Pro 3, tissues and nuts. He then checked every price on the product pages. The AI tools did not make up prices. Taobao's AI said clearly that some iPhones were used or refurbished. Doubao added up the four prices fast, but its total was a little wrong. JD.com's AI found a cheap pair of earphones that looked fake. One tool, Lingguang 2.0, watched prices for him. It sent a message when the iPhone dropped below 7500 yuan. The final price was about 7259 yuan, around 740 yuan less than the page price. But the earphone test showed a problem. JD.com's AI warned him about a fake product. Later, it recommended earphones marked as refurbished, and a shop that could not sell to him. The prices were real, but the advice was not always good.", "vocab": [{"word": "shopper", "pos": "noun", "zh": "购物者", "note": "指买东西的人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "price", "pos": "noun", "zh": "价格", "note": "常用词，复数prices", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "check", "pos": "verb", "zh": "核对；检查", "note": "check the price 核对价格", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "product", "pos": "noun", "zh": "产品；商品", "note": "product page 商品页面", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fake", "pos": "adj", "zh": "假的", "note": "a fake product 假货", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "refurbished", "pos": "adj", "zh": "翻新的；资源机", "note": "指非全新机器", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "recommend", "pos": "verb", "zh": "推荐", "note": "recommend a shop 推荐一家店", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "save money", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "省钱", "note": "save 在这里是节省的意思", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-08T00:50:52.639974", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Double", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.575, "sm": 300, "em": 574, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "11", "s": 0.575, "e": 1.025, "sm": 575, "em": 1025, "cs": 7, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "started", "s": 1.025, "e": 1.387, "sm": 1025, "em": 1387, "cs": 10, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "in", "s": 